    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The v6 rebuild keeps the proven v5 connection flow and introduces the redesigned RabbitLoader WordPress admin UI.</p>\n<p>Connected navigation:<br />\n* Dashboard<br />\n* Optimization<br />\n* Usage<br />\n* Settings<br />\n* Help</p>\n<p>The dashboard continues to read the existing RabbitLoader report/overview data.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove the Optimization Profile / Rabbit Run / Bunny Hop block.</li>\n<li>Keep Optimization focused on the URL list.</li>\n<li>Tighten admin spacing, cards and tables using the proven legacy RabbitLoader visual proportions.</li>\n<li>Use the legacy RabbitLoader Manrope typography and #0076CE primary blue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Keep the working RabbitLoader popup connection and credential storage.</li>\n<li>Replace placeholder RL branding with RabbitLoader logo treatment.</li>\n<li>Move primary UI branding from green to RabbitLoader blue.</li>\n<li>Add five-tab connected admin shell.</li>\n<li>Keep ME Mode and Purge All Pages on Dashboard.</li>\n<li>Move optimized URLs to the Optimization tab.</li>\n<li>Add Rabbit Run / Bunny Hop optimization-profile UI.</li>\n<li>Show unlimited bandwidth as an all-plan benefit instead of a metered usage card.</li>\n<li>Add dedicated Usage page and 30-day trend layout.</li>\n<li>Add Page Rules and Connection sections under Settings.</li>\n<li>Rebuild Help from the existing RabbitLoader crash-course video set.</li>\n<li>Mark not-yet-wired runtime controls as non-destructive UI preview controls.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Connect popup and proof flow.</li>\n<li>Persist api_token/domain/did.</li>\n<li>Render connected dashboard from live report/overview data.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "RabbitLoader WordPress connection and performance dashboard.",
